      "comment": "Alia: Alia and Aila",
      "content": "The twins were raised on Hiisi Island by Archpriestess Lovia as stand-ins for the sacred heir's bearer. A faded storybook of white birds gave them a promise to leave together. Alia went first, alone, and Aila endured twice the pain, later writing that she had lied to Solovei, as Alia and Lovia had, when he asked if she felt hate. Solovei later passed on Alia's last wish that Aila live happily and freely.",
