      "comment": "Alia: The Second Reed Miller",
      "content": "After Avrelian's execution Alia took up his silver mask. She turned the Treasure Hoarders into a disciplined, quasi-military order whose creed was that humanity alone can save itself, and in one night emptied the governor's palace for the poor of Nasha Town. According to Tolfin, one in five Reed Miller stories comes from her. Nod-Krai's people still revere the name, though Tolfin thinks they love the idea of loot falling into their laps, not Avrelian's dream.",
