      "comment": "Alia: The Sampo Mill and the Pillar of Embla",
      "content": "The Sampo Mill was a Frostmoon Scion relic that Avrelian stole for Rauthvangi. Rauthvangi built a tower on the site now called the Pillar of Embla and meant to drain the land's power through the Mill to ascend past the false sky to the 'Elysium' he thought lay beyond. Alia cast herself into the Mill and ignited it with her flesh and blood, stopping him. She remained in the seam between time and space inside the tower.",
