        "Pillar of Embla",
        "Avrelian"
      ],
      "comment": "Alia: Alia and Rauthvangi's final meeting",
      "content": "At the top of the Pillar of Embla the Professor mistook Alia for Avrelian ('Relya') and urged her to bend the Sampo Mill to his will. She answered that he had used Avrelian from the start, that his 'Elysium' was only ever meant for himself, and that Avrelian's fall from rank was a trap he planned with Grand Duke Alvis. She said she would end the monk in Reed Miller's name; the two vanished together.",
