      ],
      "comment": "Alia: Silver Lampwick",
      "content": "One of three sacred artifacts, the sword (Spiralblade), the lamp and the mirror, used by the Torchforger to defeat the fiend of Kipumaki Cliff. After the calamity Solovei entrusted it to Alia, who guarded it inside the Pillar of Embla. It can raise a barrier that withstands the Wild Hunt, and Illuga was sent by Nikita to recover it.",
